{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09591","headline":"虢中酬陕西甄判官见赠 · 岑参","name":"虢中酬陕西甄判官见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微才弃散地，拙宦慙清时。\n白发徒自负，青云难可期。\n胡尘暗东洛，亚相方出师。\n分陕振鼓鼙，二崤满旌旗。\n夫子廊庙器，迥然青冥姿。\n阃外佐戎律，幕中吐兵奇。\n前者驿使来，忽枉行军诗。\n昼吟庭花落，夜讽山月移。\n昔君隐苏门，浪迹不可羁。\n诏书自徵用，令誉天下知。\n别来春草长，东望转相思。\n寂寞山城暮，空闻画角悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}